    {
      "q": "What is the 2-bend rule in Mahjong Connect?",
      "a": "A connection between two identical tiles is valid if the path between them requires at most two 90-degree turns (up to 3 straight line segments) and does not cross any other occupied tiles."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can the link travel outside the board grid?",
      "a": "Yes! The border area surrounding the board is open space, allowing you to link tiles along the outer perimeter."
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I win?",
      "a": "Clear all 96 tiles from the board before the time limit expires to achieve victory."
    }
  ]
